@baseUrl = http://localhost:8004

### Synchronous run (replace thread_id; requires LLM_GATEWAY_API_KEY for llm nodes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/threads/th_replace_me/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": {"query": "What is ALADIN?"}
}

### Streaming run (replace thread_id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/threads/th_replace_me/runs:stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": {"query": "What is ALADIN?"}
}
